     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. scaling lessons from Phase I on convergence based climate resilient infrastructure planning for enhancing the resilience of vulnerable population in the three States (Odisha, Bihar and Chhattisgarh).
2. In the new States (MP, UP and Rajasthan), Project Management Units (PMUs) will be established to initiate project activities in the target districts.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
